---
---

<section class="problem" id="the-problem" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow" data-animate="fade-up">01 / The problem</p>
        <h2 id="problem-heading" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="100">
          A good match asks for more than a shade number.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-description" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="200">
        Finding foundation is rarely as simple as choosing between light and dark. Skin tone, undertone, testing conditions and how a formula wears can all shape the experience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-cards">
      <article class="problem-card" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="100">
        <span class="n">01</span>
        <h3>Limited choice.</h3>
        <p>Finding a shade that accounts for your skin tone and undertone can be difficult.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="problem-card" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="200">
        <span class="n">02</span>
        <h3>Limited testing.</h3>
        <p>Online swatches and store lighting don't always tell you how a shade looks on your own skin.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="problem-card" data-animate="fade-up" data-delay="300">
        <span class="n">03</span>
        <h3>Uncertain wear.</h3>
        <p>A shade that looks right at first may change in appearance as the formula settles and wears.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem {
    padding: 102px 0 111px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 62px;
  }

  .problem h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(49px, 5vw, 78px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -.052em;
    line-height: .98;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 670px;
  }

  .section-description {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    max-width: 425px;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    justify-self: end;
  }

  .problem-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid #BBAAB6;
  }

  .problem-card {
    padding: 27px 31px 4px 0;
    min-height: 197px;
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .problem-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .problem-card + .problem-card {
    padding-left: 32px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .problem-card .n {
    color: var(--wine);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .problem-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 33px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    margin: 28px 0 11px;
    color: var(--plum);
  }

  .problem-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.82;
    max-width: 290px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1180px) {
    .problem h2 {
      font-size: clamp(49px, 5.25vw, 71px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .problem {
      padding: 72px 0 74px;
    }
    .section-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .section-description {
      justify-self: start;
    }
    .problem h2 {
      font-size: clamp(50px, 8.4vw, 70px);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .problem {
      padding: 62px 0;
    }
    .problem h2 {
      font-size: clamp(50px, 11.5vw, 67px);
    }
    .section-description {
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .problem-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .problem-card {
      padding: 18px 0 24px;
      min-height: unset;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .problem-card + .problem-card {
      border-left: 0;
      padding-left: 0;
    }
    .problem-card h3 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin: 10px 0 8px;
    }
    .problem-card p {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
